  "name": "IntuneAccess",
  "description": "IntuneAccess is an open-source, read-only PowerShell module that connects Microsoft Intune RBAC, workload targeting, and evidence into a single local report. It correlates admins, groups, policies, devices, apps and updates to produce structured objects and an offline HTML Signal Atlas explorer. It supports findings, resolution guides, snapshot comparisons and export-only datasets without uploading tenant data.",
